            "review_title": "Review at Madame Hang Restaurant",
            "review_text": "LearneT\nSurfers Paradise, Australia77 contributions\n0\nCouldn't get out of there fast enough!\nJun 2018 • Friends\nThe fact that no one else was there should have been an indication. On arrival, 4 waitstaff gathered around us to serve. We thought we'd start with drinks. It took about 1/2 and hour to receive them and one of our guests was told after about 15 mins that they didn't have the beer he ordered from their menu. I can't imagine why they looked surprised when we asked for the bill even before the final drink arrived. If they're that slow with drinks in an empty restaurant, imagine how slow they would be with food! Tried to head upstairs to the next level of the Happy Yacht to see if it was any better and we were accosted at the lift to pay to go up. Decided to leave. All round, a very poor experience. We won't be back.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 16, 2018",
